WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.050
Whenever I travel, I
like to meet the people.

00:00:02.050 --> 00:00:04.090
So I'm in the heart of Mexico City,

00:00:04.090 --> 00:00:07.670
I'm gonna walk around and say hola.

00:00:07.670 --> 00:00:10.587
(speaking Spanish)

00:00:17.360 --> 00:00:18.730
President Trump

00:00:18.730 --> 00:00:20.750
wants to build a wall and he would like

00:00:20.750 --> 00:00:22.130
Mexico to pay for it.

00:00:22.130 --> 00:00:24.633
Would you like to make a donation?

00:00:27.670 --> 00:00:28.503
Pure love.

00:00:28.503 --> 00:00:29.336
Love?

00:00:29.336 --> 00:00:30.500
You'd put love in there?

00:00:30.500 --> 00:00:31.513
No. I need cash.

00:00:32.960 --> 00:00:34.080
We were told that you guys were

00:00:34.080 --> 00:00:35.374
going to pay for the wall and-

00:00:35.374 --> 00:00:37.160
Oh really (chuckles) oh my God.

00:00:37.160 --> 00:00:39.282
Would you like to donate to the wall?

00:00:39.282 --> 00:00:40.770
And I'm going to sweeten the deal.

00:00:40.770 --> 00:00:41.603
All right.

00:00:41.603 --> 00:00:43.130
If you donate 500 pesos, you get

00:00:43.130 --> 00:00:46.977
your name on a brick in the wall.

00:00:46.977 --> 00:00:48.182
But you have to act now because there's

00:00:48.182 --> 00:00:49.340
only going to be 800 million of these.

00:00:49.340 --> 00:00:50.320
Oh really?

00:00:50.320 --> 00:00:51.920
Yeah; for a thousand pesos, look at this.

00:00:51.920 --> 00:00:54.248
You get an, I paid for the wall.

00:00:54.248 --> 00:00:56.723
You like that, I paid for the wall?

00:00:56.723 --> 00:00:58.973
(laughter)

00:00:59.963 --> 00:01:01.270
And, I'm going to throw in this

00:01:01.270 --> 00:01:03.520
Three Tenors CD because I like you.

00:01:03.520 --> 00:01:05.260
Okay, so you got the brick,

00:01:05.260 --> 00:01:08.150
You can get the bag, you
get the Three Tenors CD,

00:01:08.150 --> 00:01:10.838
and throwing in, look at this right here.

00:01:10.838 --> 00:01:12.770
(audience groaning)

00:01:12.770 --> 00:01:14.788
That's how he spells it.

00:01:14.788 --> 00:01:15.771
What's your name?

00:01:15.771 --> 00:01:16.689
Cesar.

00:01:16.689 --> 00:01:18.643
Is there anything you'd like
to say to President Trump?

00:01:19.550 --> 00:01:22.930
(speaking Spanish)

00:01:22.930 --> 00:01:25.803
If you speak in Spanish,
Trump won't understand.

00:01:26.750 --> 00:01:29.083
If you speak in English,
he may not understand.

00:01:34.743 --> 00:01:36.513
I want to hug the grandmother, please.

00:01:38.300 --> 00:01:41.550
(cheering and talking)

00:01:42.857 --> 00:01:45.107
(laughter)

00:01:47.373 --> 00:01:50.540
He promised, he said Mexico would pay.

00:01:52.624 --> 00:01:54.603
You know that I'm a
very famous movie actor.

00:01:56.077 --> 00:01:58.018
Yeah, very handsome.

00:01:58.018 --> 00:01:59.650
You from Malcolm in the Middle?

00:01:59.650 --> 00:02:00.784
(laughter)

00:02:00.784 --> 00:02:02.267
From Malcolm in the Middle?

00:02:02.267 --> 00:02:03.517
Which one am I?

00:02:04.730 --> 00:02:08.063
(laughter and clapping)

00:02:13.434 --> 00:02:15.094
(growls, purrs)

00:02:15.094 --> 00:02:16.210
Okay. Mexico!

00:02:16.210 --> 00:02:17.950
Wow, that didn't go well.

00:02:17.950 --> 00:02:19.700
They really stoned me on the growl.

00:02:21.676 --> 00:02:23.926
(laughter)

00:02:24.770 --> 00:02:27.660
The unhappiest selfie
anyone has ever taken.

00:02:27.660 --> 00:02:30.480
(upbeat, lively music)

00:02:30.480 --> 00:02:31.670
I was wondering, does he want to

00:02:31.670 --> 00:02:33.975
donate money to build the wall.

00:02:33.975 --> 00:02:37.606
(speaking Spanish)

00:02:37.606 --> 00:02:40.330
No.
(laughter)

00:02:40.330 --> 00:02:42.930
I'm here to get money money for the wall.

00:02:42.930 --> 00:02:45.590
You know, Trump said you
guys would pay for it.

00:02:45.590 --> 00:02:48.923
(laughter and clapping)

00:02:49.810 --> 00:02:51.960
He didn't talk to any of you guys?

00:02:51.960 --> 00:02:54.740
He said you guys were
playing for the wall.

00:02:54.740 --> 00:02:55.573
We've been had!

00:02:56.880 --> 00:02:59.399
That guy's a dishonest businessman!

00:02:59.399 --> 00:03:01.649
(laughter)

00:03:03.880 --> 00:03:06.600
Conan O'Ryan, close enough, pretty good.

00:03:06.600 --> 00:03:09.250
That's a pretty good guess, Conan O'Ryan.

00:03:09.250 --> 00:03:10.880
Nice to, nice to meet you.

00:03:10.880 --> 00:03:12.880
Do you mind me holding on you like this?

00:03:13.910 --> 00:03:17.240
I'm not letting you go, right?

00:03:17.240 --> 00:03:18.333
All right, I'm not letting you go.

00:03:20.270 --> 00:03:23.288
Let's see how long I can hold on to you.

00:03:23.288 --> 00:03:26.235
(laughter)

00:03:26.235 --> 00:03:28.955
I'm just gonna hold on to you.

00:03:28.955 --> 00:03:31.110
Okay; did you have plans,
have to go somewhere?

00:03:31.110 --> 00:03:32.475
Yeah, well you're not going there

00:03:32.475 --> 00:03:34.117
because I'm holding on to you.

00:03:34.117 --> 00:03:36.377
(laughter)

00:03:36.377 --> 00:03:38.983
I'm not letting go, I'm not stopping.

00:03:40.376 --> 00:03:42.180
What is your name?

00:03:42.180 --> 00:03:43.810
Trump said that you would pay.

00:03:43.810 --> 00:03:46.233
Trump... he said you would pay.

00:03:46.233 --> 00:03:47.066
I'm not paying that.

00:03:47.066 --> 00:03:47.923
Trump said you would pay.

00:03:47.923 --> 00:03:49.253
I not pay nothing.

00:03:49.253 --> 00:03:50.336
I put this...

00:03:51.256 --> 00:03:53.506
(laughter)

